            <div xml:id="d41">

                <pb facs="0145" n="45" sameAs="frus:frus1934v01/pg45"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">500.A15A4/2472: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in Great
                        Britain</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Bingham</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1934-04-07T15:00:00-05:00">April 7, 1934—3
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>142. For Norman Davis. Your 156, April 7, 2 p.m.</p>
                <p>I quite approve your making a statement to the press along the lines you
                    suggest.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
